しまったんだけど 8.1 がサポート対象ならバグとも言えるし雑な返事をしてしまったな…しかしあんまりがんばりたくない","ts":"1622135378.240000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IqaZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"580a6e02-a3d7-476e-9434-00cfcf42e41f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"新しい quickrun.vim、雑にサポートバージョンを 8.1 くらいに引き上げたのだけど、新生 outputter/buffer 内で `win_execute()` 使ってて、これ 8.1.1418 からだった…どうしよっかな…","ts":"1622135285.238300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a+o"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6faae6a1-a5b7-4091-9c16-b55709c53570","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"なんか降ってきたw","ts":"1622131019.237000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HVuK4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"424efa2c-a99b-4b26-976c-924697f7b505","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"おー","ts":"1622130256.236800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rqj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f14167ef-e9f4-4195-b0ae-6430f77c8513","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"再現手順置いておきますね\n```$ vim -u NONE -i NONE -N test.txt\n:w```\n↑は起動したままにして別端末を開き同じディレクトリに行く (`\u0026lt;C-z\u0026gt;` とか `:sh` でもよい)\n```$ vim -u NONE -i NONE -N\n:call bufload(bufnr('test.txt', 1))```","ts":"1622130155.236500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"db7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b762c1d1-06f7-4e94-9b92-5c350eb7a35a","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":":contribute-chance:","ts":"1622129691.234400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ebg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9433a0bc-7ab5-47fd-a582-f60bc10a2781","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"たしか \u003c@U9S4G0LJW\u003e さんが本家に送るパッチのネタを探していたと思うので、贈呈しますw","ts":"1622129655.234100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"warau","count":3,"users":["U01H161HVPS","UBQ2H65JQ","U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XIpj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4ed9c6bb-19ef-4ab3-8087-20fc2dbb9789","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"まあ実際に出るのはダイアログではなくて注意文ではあるんだけど(動作を選ぶことはできない)","ts":"1622129599.233400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TYX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e2599fc8-6873-4ff0-bed8-b863c701cb81","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"つまりバグ","ts":"1622129573.232900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AeHX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"440fb75f-7db2-417e-bb74-63f4882981d4","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"ダイアログは出ないと書かれてますね","ts":"1622129447.232700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wT4/o"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\nbufload({expr})                                         *bufload()*\n                バッファ{expr}がロードされていることを保証する。バッファの名前\n                が既存のファイルを参照しているときは、そのファイルが読み込まれ\n                る。そうでなければバッファは空になる。もし既にバッファが読み込\n                まれていれば、変更はない。\n                バッファのファイルに対して既存のスワップファイルがある場合、ダ\n                イアログなしで、バッファはロードされる。\n                引数{expr}は|bufexists()|と同じように扱われる。\n \n                |method| としても使用できる:  \n                        eval 'somename'-\u0026gt;bufload()\n```","ts":"1622129438.232400","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"42a729c6-0b1e-4104-9da6-435d8999a199","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":":h bufload()","ts":"1622129438.232300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ip+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e861b66f-875a-48e1-91f2-94163bafa930","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"この場合注意文は出ない方が自然に思える","ts":"1622129336.232100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3wpMV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9d65e67e-be0c-4c78-9480-0f5064a03105","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"あ、よく読んでなかった\n注意文が出ることに対してか","ts":"1622129272.231800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uat+y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1eafd829-d597-482a-b5ae-8028f16aa60a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"`bufload()`の飛び先がこれ\n\u003chttps://github.com/vim/vim/blob/840f91f110c4790a145e76eec453326445290f21/src/buffer.c#L147\u003e","ts":"1622129196.231000","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: vim/vim","id":1,"title":"vim/vim","title_link":"https://github.com/vim/vim/blob/840f91f110c4790a145e76eec453326445290f21/src/buffer.c#L147","text":"The official Vim repository. Contribute to vim/vim development by creating an account on GitHub.","image_url":"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/a9c9a18402f254599255a3f57de74f151eb199050d7d61ab242e5890b7684257/vim/vim","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/vim/vim/blob/840f91f110c4790a145e76eec453326445290f21/src/buffer.c#L147","original_url":"https://github.com/vim/vim/blob/840f91f110c4790a145e76eec453326445290f21/src/buffer.c#L147"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bRAkH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"decca5db-3641-4dac-baa8-d904a5d48987","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ソース見たけど仕様ですね、コメントに明記されてる","ts":"1622129129.230600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6u+7l"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4bbf4d22-82ff-4f74-b079-e3cbbe69b945","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`bufload()` でバッファをロードしようとした際、swap ファイルが見つかると E325 が発生し、swap ファイルが見つかった際の注意文が表示される。この時 SwapExists イベントは発生しない。\nこれはバグか否か…とりあえず `bufload()` はスクリプト中で必要になって呼ばれるケースがほとんどで、その最中に注意文が出て嬉しいケースはあまりないように思える","ts":"1622128898.230500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gbXj"}]}]
